ed_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Adds LOCAL immutable artifact staging to the existing ResultStore tables, with separate artifact columns and strict isolation from legacy financial reads, recovery and cleanup. Cross-kind and logical identity checks run under SQLite writer serialization. Exact retries survive restart; conflicting descriptor, intent or artifact bindings refuse replacement. A local helper checks the actual Meta artifact bytes against descriptor core fields. No registry, storage authority or second ledger is introduced.\r\n\r\nPositive artifact projection and read ALWAYS refuse with ARTIFACT_AUTHORITY_ABI_UNAVAILABLE. No JSON-shaped receipt, callback or native proof is accepted. publication_receipt remains NULL. Full A2/A4 receipt ABI and two-domain publication remain unavailable.\r\n\r\nValidation on exact 887e3eeaf23ef8d9d1429435bc88bbac8099c6e6 / tree 954f3364cb70369705f658e89fcc6ae8ce547eec: 45 local tests passed, 0 skips; 806 primary files match actual Git blobs before and after with no extras. Independent reviewer ran 44 store tests; A4 independently verified 3 initialization failure/lifecycle checks and issued scoped local source compatibility ACK. Both migration races were reproduced before correction: concurrent first-upgrade and traceback-retained writer lock. Original SQL errors, corrupt schemas and failure evidence are preserved. Broader related regression: 80 passed / 3 existing skips before the last three cleanup tests.\r\n\r\nRoot explicitly allocated three test harness files copied byte-for-byte from cddf71: pinned Meta/full-CI environment, sibling test support import and tmp_path service-manager fixture. Their raw copy receipt and exact inherited diff are committed. No v2 runtime, schemas or packet transferred; base remains frozen aed8.\r\n\r\nFull configured Slice A suite on that exact HEAD: 2127 passed / 36 existing skips / 35 subtests, exit 0. All 806 raw primary files remain byte-identical with no extras after the run. Agent 8 independently verified 45 targeted tests and source/old-new failure cleanup; its full-suite rerun is NOT claimed. Hosted CI remains queued, without a terminal PASS. Local staging is not publication, durability, current authority, native or physical acceptance. Overall NO-GO; no merge requested.\r\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-11-07T17:02:30Z","updated_at":"2026-11-07T17:14:05Z","closed_at":null,"merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"7125e6566f0509247817d8b93f35104fcd7cc330","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"YehorBabenko88:feature/artifact-result-store-successor-20261107","ref":"feature/artifact-result-store-successor-20261107","repo":{"id":1399536291,"node_id":"R_kgDOU2s6ow","name":"strattester","full_name":"YehorBabenko88/strattester","owner":{"login":"YehorBabenko88","id":304050327,"node_id":"U_kgDOEh9wlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/304050327?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88","html_url":"https://github.com/YehorBabenko88","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/YehorBabenko88/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"private":false,"fork":false,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"description":null,"homepage":null,"l